  "repositoryControlledGaps": [
    "Obtain green exact-head, current-main and ordered-parent synthetic-merge receipts for the final source snapshot, including blocking CI, Agentd process qualification, repository integrity, package tests, all-target Clippy, formatting, clean source and CodeQL.",
    "Qualify Agentd on a named protected host. Durable external frontier recovery, protected launcher isolation and real-process lifecycle kill-point tests remain external gates.",
    "Bind the checked lifecycle append to the selected durable backend and prove uncertain-commit reconciliation; repository source now enforces exact committed-record idempotency plus monotonic identity, frontier, fence, terminal and quarantine transitions.",
    "Prove a killable worker boundary with enforced CPU, RSS, allocation and wall-time limits; cooperative cancellation and bounded permits are not hard isolation.",
    "Compose and qualify a real text encoder plus a selected durable vector-index port backend and deployed store; repository source now enforces checked CAS, exact replay, typed unknown commit outcomes, exact reload reconciliation and post-commit confirmation, but compatibility remains the only activation mode.",
    "Execute the recovery matrix and nine-stage E2E matrix with real processes, at least 100 samples per case, and actual allocation, SQLite, CPU/RSS, contention and worker-exit counters against approved SLOs.",
    "Retain exact-head raw evidence in independently governed immutable storage; Git and 90-day artifacts are not external WORM evidence."
  ],
